on":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 4.7\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115763 made a change to semantics regarding function signatures. However the code is placed in `TOOLS_ENABLED` and does not apply to released builds.\n\nThis means that some functions have a set return type in editor but a Variant return type in exported games. This might lead to some compiler issues down the line.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Use the MRP from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111536\n- Notice a compiler error in editor builds\n- Notice that the crash is still reproducible after exporting the MRP\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111536\n\n\n\n\n\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121047/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}